"properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"黒森","category":"nature","address":"山地（非火山性）景観 / 非火山性弧峰","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"02443","municipality_pref":"青森県","municipality_name":"田子町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"205"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[141.04608154296875,40.24003601074219]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"弥勒ノ滝","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 滝","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"02443","municipality_pref":"青森県","municipality_name":"田子町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"610"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.95912170410156,40.29441833496094]}}],"display_comment_original":"田子町周辺には、近世村の記憶として夏坂村、関村、山口村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、夏坂番所跡、茂市館跡、石亀館跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、夏坂村、関村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板を、既存ピンと照らして歩くと発見しやすい。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":[],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["大黒森","和平高原","みろくの滝","田子館","日ノ沢館址","旧橋本家住宅 〔田子字川代ノ上ミ〕","真清田神社","田子神楽"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%94%B0%E5%AD%90%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"田子町","wikipedia_revision_id":"108312001","wikidata_qid":"Q1349168","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%94%B0%E5%AD%90%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}